# User-private files (NOT to be committed)
# Note: upload/ folder used to be ignored, but user actually need some files from GitHub
# (e.g. wiktionary XML, kamus JSON). So we ignore specific patterns instead of whole /upload/.
/upload/Pasted*
/upload/Screenshot*
/upload/*.png
/upload/*-home.json
/upload/voicertool-research/
/upload/wiktionary/      # 86MB XML — too big for repo, user re-download from https://jv.wiktionary.org/wiki/Istimewa:Export
/upload/mendeley/        # duplikat public/kamus-jawa-mendeley-raw.json — sumber asli mendeley.com
/download/    # generated split SRT outputs + hasil download user
/tool-results/ # debug output dari Read/Grep tool — JANGAN commit

# Python bytecode cache (auto-generated, jangan commit)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Build artifacts that aren't needed in repo
Caddyfile

# ZIP files (jangan commit ke repo, kecuali kalau memang distribusi)
*.zip

# Kamus Jawa legacy — R-20: kamus-jawa-draft.json = rujukan tunggal.
# kamus-jawa-full.json (12 MiB) dan .gz (1.5 MiB) = LEGACY raw, BUKAN rujukan.
# Build script (build-kamus-bersih.py.DISABLED) sudah di-disable — JANGAN rebuild dari raw.
/public/kamus-jawa-full.json
/public/kamus-jawa-full.json.gz

# Kamus Jawa JSON — TRACK di git supaya user bisa download dari GitHub (MacBook user)
# File yang TETAP di-git (user curl dari MacBook):
#   public/kamus-jawa-draft.json (17MB, AKTIF — rujukan tunggal per R-20)
#   public/angka-raw.json (172KB, angka 1-1000 + ejaan fix v6.1)
#   public/dasanama-raw.csv (48KB, sinonim Jawa)
#   public/kamus-jawa-mendeley-raw.json (148KB, Mendeley dataset)
#   public/lampiran-raw.json (436KB, Lampiran Kamus Jawa-Indonesia)
#   public/lampiran-angka-raw.json (8KB, Lampiran Nama angka)
#   public/kamus-jawa-new-lemma.json (208KB, id.wiktionary jv:Lema)
#   public/audit-suspects.json (88KB, hasil audit otomatis — R-19)
# File yang DIHAPUS dari git (R-20: raw bukan rujukan lagi):
#   public/kamus-jawa-full.json (12MB, LEGACY) — DIHAPUS
#   public/kamus-jawa-full.json.gz (1.5MB, backup) — DIHAPUS (R-20: JANGAN sisakan backup legacy)

